   :alt: Seeed Studio XIAO (6x10 RGB) MATRIX WS2812 LED Test Pattern

.. rubric:: WS2812 LED Test Pattern by SPI, Pulse IO, or PIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`led-strip`.

