   .. group-tab:: BLE (Sense)

      .. rubric:: On XIAO BLE

      .. zephyr-app-commands::
         :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/led/led_strip
         :build-dir: seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix-strip_test
         :board: xiao_ble/nrf52840
         :shield: "seeed_xiao_6x10_rgb_matrix"
         :west-args: -p
         :flash-args: -r uf2
         :goals: flash
         :compact:

